or a thrilling adventure! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224060/extras/fb648befceee2354edb1a5a796fce721.poster.avif?t=1727445516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224060/extras/fb648befceee2354edb1a5a796fce721.webm?t=1727445516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224060/extras/fb648befceee2354edb1a5a796fce721.mp4?t=1727445516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beautifully Crafted Environments! </strong></h2>Catrophy Trail is set in an open and expansive world of lush and imaginative environments. <br>With a strong emphasis on nature and a hand-painted aesthetic, the world is built with a soft, pastel color palette and a sense of majesty and wonder. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224060/extras/6532e17368c65c658c727fdaad05ea7d.poster.avif?t=1727445516\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224060/extras/6532e17368c65c658c727fdaad05ea7d.webm?t=1727445516\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224060/extras/6532e17368c65c658c727fdaad05ea7d.mp4?t=1727445516\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
